<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compressĭo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conp-</span></b> ),
		ōnis, f.
		com primo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pressing together, compression</i>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aurum compressione coactum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					7, 8, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Oros. 7, 6</span></i>.— With
				<i>gen.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ventris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					16, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">musculorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 84</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Esp.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>An embracing</i>: artae amantūm,
			* <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ps. 1, 1, 64</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Copulation</i>, <i><span class="en">Arn. 2,
			93</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab. 187</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Marc. 4,
			34</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of diction, <i>the
				compression of an expression</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Brut. 7,
				29</span></i>; v. Ellendt. ad h. l.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A suppression, repression</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">bellorum civilium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Oros. 7, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corporalium cupiditatum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. in Psa. 48</span></i>
			, Serm. 19, § 19.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
